# --- Build / state files ---
# scripts/formula_count.txt holds the last live-counted row count; it's
# refreshed every CI run from Supabase, so tracking it would force a
# push-back loop. Same for deploy_staging/ which is the unzipped frontend
# bundle the deploy.yml workflow creates on the runner.
scripts/formula_count.txt
deploy_staging/

